["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Your Tikka teaches recoil. Your CZ teaches everything else, hundreds of shots a season, for the price of a few .308 boxes.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 396\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Scaling a deer vital zone of about 20 cm to a target at 50 m. A 10 cm dot at 50 m is the same angle as the vitals at 100 m, 5 cm is 200 m, 3.3 cm is 300 m and 2.5 cm is 400 m. Dot size equals 20 cm times 50 divided by the deer distance.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"396\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Shrink the deer to 50 m</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Deer vitals: about 20 to 25 cm (70%).</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Same angle on a target at 50 m:</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"120\" r=\"26.0\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">10 cm dot</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">= deer at 100 m</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"178\" r=\"13.0\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">5 cm dot</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">= deer at 200 m</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"236\" r=\"8.6\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">3.3 cm dot</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">= deer at 300 m</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"294\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">2.5 cm dot</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">= deer at 400 m</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"350\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"372.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Dot size = 20 cm x 50 / deer distance</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Shrink the deer's vital zone to 50 m <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>A 5 cm dot at 50 m = the vitals at 200 m <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: why scaled targets work</summary><ul><li>A deer's vital zone is about 20 to 25 cm (8 to 10 in) across (70%, <a href=\"#/s/shooting-skills\">shooting skills</a>).</li><li>Same angle, shorter distance: dot size = 20 cm x 50 m / deer distance (95%, geometry). 10 cm = 100 m, 5 cm = 200 m, 3.3 cm = 300 m, 2.5 cm = 400 m.</li><li>What it does not train: recoil, wind at long range and the .308's drop. Mix in Tikka sessions (Tip).</li><li>A .22 round costs a small fraction of a .308 round (65%, <a href=\"#/s/rimfire-22\">the .22 rimfire</a> estimate). <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> current prices at your shop.</li><li>Every game here is a Tip: a training idea, not a fact.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 372\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The dot game card: six orange dots, three 5 cm dots and three 2.5 cm dots, one shot each at 50 m. One shot per dot from a new position each time. A hit scores one point, a total out of 6. Log it and try to beat it.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"372\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Game 1: the dot card</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"360\" height=\"230\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"100\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"100\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"100\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"210\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">4</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"210\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">5</text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"210\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">6</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">5 cm dots: 1 shot each</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">2.5 cm dots: 1 shot each</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"295\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">1 shot per dot, a new position each</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"319\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Hit = 1 point. Miss = 0. Max 6</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"343\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"348\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"348\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Log the score. Beat it next week</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>6 shots, 6 dots, a new position each (Tip).</li><li>Log the score. Beat it next week (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to play</summary><ul><li>Print or draw three 5 cm dots and three 2.5 cm dots on one sheet (Tip).</li><li>At 50 m: one shot per dot. Prone for dot 1, then sitting, kneeling, standing with sticks (Tip).</li><li>Score 1 per hit. 5 or 6: you are a 200 m deer shot from those positions with that rifle and you; 3 or less: practise that position (Tip).</li><li>Start with the safety ON between shots; push it off only when the sights settle (95%, CZ rule 12).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 330\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The positions game: four cards, 1 prone, 2 sitting with shooting sticks, 3 kneeling, 4 standing with sticks. Each has a par time to get into position and fire one aimed shot: 60, 45, 30 and 20 seconds. Par times are a Tip; start slow and cut them.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Game 2: four positions</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"44\" width=\"184\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"106\" cy=\"108\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><path d=\"M42 116 L100 114\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"142\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"62\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Prone</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">60 s</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"44\" width=\"184\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"274\" cy=\"86\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><path d=\"M268 94 L264 118 L290 118 L294 130\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"264\" y1=\"94\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><line x1=\"304\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"222\" cy=\"62\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"222\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Sitting, sticks</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">45 s</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"172\" width=\"184\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"206\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><path d=\"M80 214 L78 240 L68 260 M78 240 L98 242 L100 260\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"214\" x2=\"138\" y2=\"208\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"190\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Kneeling</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">30 s</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"172\" width=\"184\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"274\" cy=\"204\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><path d=\"M274 212 L274 244 L266 272 M274 244 L282 272\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"264\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"206\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><line x1=\"308\" y1=\"208\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"312\" y1=\"208\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"222\" cy=\"190\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"222\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">4</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Standing, sticks</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">20 s</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"318\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Par times are a Tip: start slow, then cut them.</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Get into position and fire one aimed shot inside the par time (Tip).</li><li>A deer will not wait for a bench (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to play</summary><ul><li>Start standing, rifle slung, magazine in, chamber empty, safety ON (Tip). Range rules may say otherwise: follow them.</li><li>On \"go\": get into position, chamber a round, safety off on target, one shot at a 5 cm dot at 50 m (Tip).</li><li>Score: hit inside the par = 2, hit over the par = 1, miss = 0 (Tip).</li><li>Positions: <a href=\"#/s/field-positions\">field positions</a>. <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Shooting sticks\">Shooting sticks</button> count as a field rest (Tip).</li><li>Grandpa's twist: one shot in each position after a 50 m jog. Heart rate up, like after a climb (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 322\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The cold shot game: a week calendar with one shot a day, scored 1 for a hit and 0 for a miss on a 5 cm dot. Only the first shot of the day counts, no warm up, from a real field position. The deer gets your first shot, so train the first shot.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"322\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Game 3: one cold shot a day</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"50\" width=\"48\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Mon</text><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"98\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><rect x=\"68\" y=\"50\" width=\"48\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Tue</text><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"98\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><rect x=\"122\" y=\"50\" width=\"48\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"146\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Wed</text><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"98\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"146\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">0</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"50\" width=\"48\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Thu</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"98\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"50\" width=\"48\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"254\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Fri</text><circle cx=\"254\" cy=\"98\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"254\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><rect x=\"284\" y=\"50\" width=\"48\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Sat</text><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"98\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><rect x=\"338\" y=\"50\" width=\"48\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"362\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Sun</text><circle cx=\"362\" cy=\"98\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"362\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"155\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">First shot of the day only</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"181\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">No warm up, no sighters</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"207\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">From the field position you would use</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"233\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">4</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Score hit or miss on a 5 cm dot</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"276\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"298.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">The deer gets your first shot. Train it.</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Only the first shot counts (Tip).</li><li>The deer always gets your first shot (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to play</summary><ul><li>One shot, no warm up, from the position you would use in the bush, at a 5 cm dot at 50 m (Tip).</li><li>Where you can do this: a range or a legal place to shoot. Never in a no shooting area or a bylaw area (99%, see <a href=\"#/s/rb-region-2\">Region 2</a> and <a href=\"#/s/local-mission\">Local plan: Mission</a>).</li><li>Mark the calendar: 1 or 0. Ten in a row: move to the 2.5 cm dot (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 342\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The flinch game: a partner loads the magazine with live rounds and a snap cap mixed in while you do not look. When the striker falls on the snap cap, any dip of the muzzle shows a flinch. Fix it with a slow squeeze, follow through and calling the shot.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"342\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Game 4: catch a flinch</text><g transform=\"translate(0 0) scale(1.0)\"><path d=\"M14 108 L128 116 L140 118 L300 120 Q314 121 318 126 L318 132 Q300 138 250 140 L200 141 L162 141 Q150 141 146 150 L136 170 Q132 176 124 174 L120 172 Q126 156 122 146 Q112 142 96 146 L14 168 Z\" fill=\"#9A6B3F\"/><path d=\"M30 116 Q80 120 120 124\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"106\" width=\"8\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M232 105 L390 107 L390 115 L232 117 Z\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"386\" y=\"106\" width=\"5\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"99\" width=\"16\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"266\" y=\"96\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M374 107 L376 97 L388 97 L388 107 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"102\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"99\" width=\"78\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#8C959B\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"100\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"100\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"105\" width=\"36\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"106\" width=\"36\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#C9CFD3\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"104\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"121\" y=\"107\" width=\"8\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><path d=\"M153 111 L148 131\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"147\" cy=\"136\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"119\" width=\"22\" height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"122\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"131\" y=\"117.5\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#D8B23A\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\".8\"/><path d=\"M158 141 Q156 160 176 160 L196 160 Q204 160 204 141\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M178 141 Q183 150 176 156\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"208\" y=\"138\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"231\" y=\"139\" width=\"4\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"158\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"138\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(60 230) rotate(0) scale(2.0)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-5\" width=\"24\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#D8B23A\" stroke=\"#8A6D12\" stroke-width=\".8\"/><rect x=\"-2\" y=\"-6\" width=\"3\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#B8931F\"/><path d=\"M24 -4.5 L33 -4 Q40 0 33 4 L24 4.5 Z\" fill=\"#B0703A\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(170 230) rotate(0) scale(2.0)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-5\" width=\"24\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#D8B23A\" stroke=\"#8A6D12\" stroke-width=\".8\"/><rect x=\"-2\" y=\"-6\" width=\"3\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#B8931F\"/><path d=\"M24 -4.5 L33 -4 Q40 0 33 4 L24 4.5 Z\" fill=\"#B0703A\"/></g><rect x=\"282\" y=\"220\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"314\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">snap</text><text x=\"98\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Live</text><text x=\"208\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Live</text><text x=\"314\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Snap cap</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">A partner loads the magazine. You do not look.</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"295\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Rifle dips on a snap cap? Flinch.</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"319\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Fix: squeeze, follow through, call the shot</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>A dip on a snap cap shows a flinch (Tip).</li><li>Squeeze, follow through, call the shot (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to play</summary><ul><li>A partner loads the magazine with live rounds and one <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Snap cap\">Snap cap</button>, out of your sight (Tip).</li><li>Snap caps are what CZ says to use for dry training (95%, CZ manual page 5).</li><li>Rimfire snap caps wear out; replace dented ones (Tip).</li><li>Call the shot: say where the crosshair was when it broke, then check the paper (Tip).</li><li>Then do the same with the Tikka. Flinch shows up on the big gun first (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 320\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two pictures. Left: a grouse up in a tree with only sky behind it; the bullet keeps going, a .22 can carry over a kilometre, so no shot. Right: a grouse on the ground on a slope with earth behind; the bullet stops in the dirt, so the shot can be safe.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"320\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Earth behind every shot</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"44\" width=\"184\" height=\"200\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#CFE3EE\"/><rect x=\"204\" y=\"44\" width=\"184\" height=\"200\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#CFE3EE\"/><path d=\"M204 150 Q300 120 388 160 L388 244 L204 244 Z\" fill=\"#7A6A4F\"/><path d=\"M12 210 L196 210 L196 244 L12 244 Z\" fill=\"#7A6A4F\"/><rect x=\"57\" y=\"110\" width=\"6\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#6E4A2A\"/><path d=\"M34 150 L60 70 L86 150 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"147\" y=\"110\" width=\"6\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#6E4A2A\"/><path d=\"M124 150 L150 70 L176 150 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"96\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#9A6B3F\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"11\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#9A6B3F\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"139.1\" y2=\"106.6\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M146 98 L134.4 102.8 L143.8 110.3z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"236\" x2=\"286.1\" y2=\"163.3\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M292 154 L281.0 160.1 L291.2 166.5z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">NO: sky behind</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">YES: earth behind</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">A .22 can carry</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"308\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">over 1 km (65%)</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Bullet stops in</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"308\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">the dirt</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Walk a range trail with paper \"grouse\" heads (Tip).</li><li>Before each shot, say the backstop out loud (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to play</summary><ul><li>Staple 4 cm squares (about a grouse head) at 10 to 40 m along a range walking course, some on the ground, some high (Tip).</li><li>Rule: no shot unless earth is behind the target. High targets with sky behind: say \"no shot\" and score a point for the call (Tip).</li><li>This builds the habit for real grouse, where the backstop rule saves lives (Tip; CZ rule 15, 95%).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Weeks before deer season</th><th>CZ games</th><th>Tikka</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>8 to 5</td><td>Dot card, positions, 2 times a week</td><td>Zero check</td></tr><tr><td>4 to 2</td><td>Cold shot daily, flinch game</td><td>10 rounds a week from field positions</td></tr><tr><td>Last week</td><td>Cold shot only</td><td>Confirm zero, then stop</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>All of this table is a Tip.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: more</summary><ul><li>Full plan: <a href=\"#/s/season-practice\">season practice plan</a>.</li><li>Keep a log: date, game, score, ammo, weather (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 396\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Scaling a deer vital zone of about 20 cm to a target at 50 m. A 10 cm dot at 50 m is the same angle as the vitals at 100 m, 5 cm is 200 m, 3.3 cm is 300 m and 2.5 cm is 400 m. Dot size equals 20 cm times 50 divided by the deer distance.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"396\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Shrink the deer to 50 m</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Deer vitals: about 20 to 25 cm (70%).</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Same angle on a target at 50 m:</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"120\" r=\"26.0\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">10 cm dot</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">= deer at 100 m</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"178\" r=\"13.0\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">5 cm dot</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">= deer at 200 m</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"236\" r=\"8.6\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">3.3 cm dot</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">= deer at 300 m</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"294\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">2.5 cm dot</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">= deer at 400 m</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"350\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"372.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Dot size = 20 cm x 50 / deer distance</text></svg>\n</figure><aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Small dot, small miss. Practise on the dot, not the deer.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Only shooting off a bench. The deer shot will be off sticks or a knee.</li><li>Shooting fast groups. Train one perfect shot at a time.</li><li>Ignoring wind at 50 m. A breeze moves a .22 several cm <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>This week: one dot card at 50 m. Write the score in the app's journal.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Geometry <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Vital zone size <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>. Games and plans: Tips. CZ manual for snap caps and safety <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li>Vital zone 20 to 25 cm: <a href=\"#/s/shooting-skills\">shooting skills</a> lesson <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Scaling and click math: geometry <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://czubpimstorage.blob.core.windows.net/strapi-pim/assets/735342000443_CZ_457_05_2025_en_es_cs_de_fr_8dc25ceb9d.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CZ 457 instruction manual, 05 2025 (PDF)</a>: snap caps for dry training (page 5), safety rules 12 and 15 (pages 2 and 3). Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Wind on a .22: <a href=\"#/s/rimfire-22\">the .22 rimfire</a>, Hunt Mentor model <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>No shooting and bylaw areas: <a href=\"#/s/rb-region-2\">Region 2</a>, <a href=\"#/s/local-mission\">Local plan: Mission</a> <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul></details>"]